  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Tai Bai Yun Sheng brings news of it from Eastern Sea: Shark Demon’s wife Su Bai Man obtained this time path Immortal Gu after defeating strong foes.",
        "chapters": [
          746
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
          "reg_eastern_sea",
          "char_shark_demon",
          "char_su_bai_man",
          "path_time"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "With Landscape as Before Gu, a mountain or river can be restored to a chosen earlier period. With Man as Before Immortal Gu, a target can theoretically be returned to that target’s body condition at a marked time, and Man as Before’s single-instant limit can be exceeded. Forming that coordination still needs many mortal Gu, and may need further Immortal Gu, as an immortal killer move rather than a bare two-Gu pairing.",
        "chapters": [
          746
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "pairings",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_landscape_as_before_gu",
          "gu_man_as_before_immortal_gu",
          "move_man_as_before",
          "sys_mortal_gu",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Su Bai Man obtained the Gu without knowing its use, became an immortal zombie from her injuries, and only years later learned what Time Anchor did. Shark Demon became an immortal zombie to accompany her. By then neither had left a mark before zombification.",
        "chapters": [
          746
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "pairings",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Later, Shark Demon’s side holds Time Anchor for use with Man as Before as a revival hope.",
        "chapters": [
          819
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "pairings",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan lists that Man as Before plus Time Anchor pairing as the first time path revival method he collected, while calling it a conjecture that would need Shark Demon’s cooperation and heavy investment.",
        "chapters": [
          938
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "pairings",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Shark Demon’s group also floats a workaround that uses an Immortal Gu like Spring Autumn Cicada to bring a Gu Immortal before the river of time, leave a mark upstream with Time Anchor, then use Man as Before.",
        "chapters": [
          746
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "pairings",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_spring_autumn_cicada",
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
